# Phase indexes

`FASE_1.md`, `FASE_2.md`, `FASE_3.md` are perennial maps.

## Required pattern

- Short phase goal in PT-BR
- Point to README for the fixed study loop
- Per-subject task lists linking to each day’s **teoria.md**:

```markdown
- [ ] [Dia 01 — Título](fase-1/fisica/dia-01-slug/teoria.md)
```

## Rules

- Use paths from repo root (Docsify `relativePath: false`)
- When adding/renaming/reordering day folders, update `FASE_n.md` in the same change
- Placeholders for empty subjects are allowed until content exists
